<title>FINLAND: KESKO APPOINTS NEW SECTOR DIRECTORS.</title>
<headline>KESKO APPOINTS NEW SECTOR DIRECTORS.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish wholesaler Kesko Oy said in a statement on Monday it had appointed four new sector directors as of May 1.</p>
<p>Kalervo Haapaniemi was appointed director for the foodstuffs division, Matti Kotola will head the home and speciality goods unit, Paavo Moilanen was appointed as director of the builders' and agricultural supplies division and Heikki Valkjarvi will head the administration unit, Kesko said.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50240, e-mail news@reuters.fi</p>
